From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: openEuler RISC-V Package Automation <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] cmake: target the stable release and Qt 6.5

The official v5.3.1 archive still identifies itself as the 5.3.50
development series.  Report the tagged stable version instead.

openEuler 24.03 LTS SP3 provides Qt 6.5.2.  The upstream change that raised
the minimum to Qt 6.6 only raised versioned QML imports; the v5.3.1 archive
has since converted those imports to versionless form.  Accept the target
Qt release without disabling any MediaWriter component.

Patch-Source: downstream review of official v5.3.1 and upstream commit 662756df424374c2c0b1a2edced475737ea6e18e
Patch-License: GPL-2.0-or-later
Upstream-Status: Not Submitted (automated upstream writes forbidden)
Remove-When: The packaged upstream release reports its stable version and supports the target Qt release directly, or openEuler supplies Qt 6.6 or newer.
---
 CMakeLists.txt | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -12 +12 @@ set(MEDIAWRITER_MINOR_VERSION "3")
-set(MEDIAWRITER_MICRO_VERSION "50")
+set(MEDIAWRITER_MICRO_VERSION "1")
@@ -15 +15 @@ set(MEDIAWRITER_VERSION "${MEDIAWRITER_MAJOR_VERSION}.${MEDIAWRITER_MINOR_VERSION}
-set(QT_MIN_VERSION "6.6.0")
+set(QT_MIN_VERSION "6.5.2")
--
2.50.1
